OL,3,GSouth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FApart from a
OL,6,Fvery isolated shower it will be a dry
OL,7,Fevening and night. Some bright or
OL,8,Fsunny breaks to end the day with
OL,9,Fvariable cloud and clear spells
OL,10,Fovernight, cloudiest to the west.
OL,11,FWinds easing somewhat but reaming
OL,12,Fbreezy.
OL,13,
OL,14,CMonday:FMonday will get off to a dry
OL,15,Fstart with bright spells, and it
OL,16,Fshould remain dry throughout the day
OL,17,Fwith an increasingly sunny afternoon
OL,18,Funfolding. Cloud feeding into Cornwall
OL,19,Flater.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
